y\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Protein Expression\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Protein Expression' activity evaluates the levels and patterns of protein expression.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Sample ID\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Sample ID: integer between 1 and 99999' uniquely identifies each biological sample processed in the workflow.\",\"min_value\":1,\"max_value\":99999,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Analyze Protein Expression: Sample ID' links the 'Analyze Protein Expression' activity with the 'Sample ID' attribute.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract DNA' must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Extract DNA\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract DNA' activity represents the initial step of isolating DNA from a biological sample.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Quantify DNA' activity must occur at least once in the process.\",\"template\":\"Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Quantify DNA\",\"description\":\"The 'Quantify DNA' activity involves measuring the concentration of the extracted DNA.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":1},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract Protein' must not occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Absence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Extract Protein\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract Protein' activity isolates proteins from the harvested cells.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Protein Expression' must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Protein Expression\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Protein Expression' activity evaluates the levels and patterns of protein expression.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Gel Electrophoresis' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Purify PCR Product' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gel Electrophoresis\",\"description\":\"The 'Gel Electrophoresis' activity separates DNA fragments based on size using an electric field.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Purify PCR Product\",\"description\":\"The 'Purify PCR Product' activity cleans up the amplified DNA to remove impurities.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Sanger Sequence' activity occurs, then an 'Analyze Sequences' activity must eventually occur after the 'Sanger Sequence' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Sanger Sequence' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Analyze Sequences' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Sanger Sequence'. If 'Sanger Sequence' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Analyze Sequences'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Sanger Sequence\",\"description\":\"The 'Sanger Sequence' activity performs DNA sequencing using the Sanger method.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Sequences\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Sequences' activity involves examining the resulting DNA sequences for quality and content.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Transform Cells' activity must be followed by a 'Culture Cells' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Culture Cells' event can occur only if a 'Transform Cells' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Transform Cells' impose obligations for future 'Culture Cells', and 'Culture Cells' cannot occur without prior 'Transform Cells'. Multiple 'Transform Cells' and 'Culture Cells' are allowed, with each 'Transform Cells' eventually leading to a 'Culture Cells' and each 'Culture Cells' being justified by a preceding 'Transform Cells'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Transform Cells\",\"description\":\"The 'Transform Cells' activity introduces the cloned DNA into competent cells.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Culture Cells\",\"description\":\"The 'Culture Cells' activity grows the transformed cells in a nutrient medium.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract Protein' activity can occur only if it is immediately preceded by 'Quantify Protein' activity, with no other activities occurring in between.\",\"template\":\"Chain Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Extract Protein\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract Protein' activity isolates proteins from the harvested cells.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Quantify Protein\",\"description\":\"The 'Quantify Protein' activity measures the amount of extracted protein.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Western Blot' activity occurs with a chosen 'Antibody Type', it must be immediately followed by an 'Analyze Protein Expression' activity in the next event position with no other events in between. The 'Analyze Protein Expression' activity is allowed to happen isolated.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Western Blot\",\"description\":\"The 'Western Blot' activity detects specific proteins using antibodies.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Protein Expression\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Protein Expression' activity evaluates the levels and patterns of protein expression.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'PCR Amplify' activity occurs, then 'Gel Electrophoresis' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice-versa.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"PCR Amplify\",\"description\":\"The 'PCR Amplify' activity represents the polymerase chain reaction to amplify specific DNA segments.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Gel Electrophoresis\",\"description\":\"The 'Gel Electrophoresis' activity separates DNA fragments based on size using an electric field.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'PCR Amplify' activity can occur only if it was immediately preceded by a 'Quantify DNA' activity, and no other 'Quantify DNA' event is allowed between the 'Quantify DNA' and the 'PCR Amplify'. This constraint is activated when the time between the activities is between 0 and 30 minutes.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"PCR Amplify\",\"description\":\"The 'PCR Amplify' activity represents the polymerase chain reaction to amplify specific DNA segments.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Quantify DNA\",\"description\":\"The 'Quantify DNA' activity involves measuring the concentration of the extracted DNA.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,30,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Culture Cells' activity occurs, then 'Harvest Cells' activity must occur after that 'Culture Cells' event and before any subsequent 'Culture Cells' occurs no other occurrence of 'Culture Cells' is allowed between an 'Culture Cells' and 'Harvest Cells'. This constraint is activated when the time between the activities is between 0 and 1 hours.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Culture Cells\",\"description\":\"The 'Culture Cells' activity grows the transformed cells in a nutrient medium.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Harvest Cells\",\"description\":\"The 'Harvest Cells' activity collects the cultured cells for further processing.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,1,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'PCR Amplify' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Gel Electrophoresis' activity, with no other events in between. Conversely, whenever a 'Gel Electrophoresis' event occurs, it must be immediately preceded by a 'PCR Amplify' event, with no other events in between. This constraint is activated when the time between the activities is between 0 and 15 minutes.\",\"template\":\"Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"PCR Amplify\",\"description\":\"The 'PCR Amplify' activity represents the polymerase chain reaction to amplify specific DNA segments.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Gel Electrophoresis\",\"description\":\"The 'Gel Electrophoresis' activity separates DNA fragments based on size using an electric field.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,15,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract Protein' activity and the 'Quantify Protein' activity cannot both occur within the same process instance. This means that if 'Extract Protein' event occurs one or more times, 'Quantify Protein' must not occur at all in that process instance, and vice-versa. It is acceptable for neither event to occur. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusion between 'Extract Protein' and 'Quantify Protein', allowing for different process variants based on which event (if any) occurs.\",\"template\":\"Not Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Extract Protein\",\"description\":\"The 'Extract Protein' activity isolates proteins from the harvested cells.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Quantify Protein\",\"description\":\"The 'Quantify Protein' activity measures the amount of extracted protein.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Exactly one of the activities 'Clone DNA' or 'Transform Cells' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if only 'Clone DNA' event occurs without any occurrence of 'Transform Cells' event, or only 'Transform Cells' occurs without any occurrence of 'Clone DNA'. The process is non-compliant if both 'Clone DNA' and 'Transform Cells' occur, or if neither occurs. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusivity and a mandatory occurrence of one of the specified activities.\",\"template\":\"Exclusive Choice\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Clone DNA\",\"description\":\"The 'Clone DNA' activity inserts DNA into a vector for replication in host cells.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Transform Cells\",\"description\":\"The 'Transform Cells' activity introduces the cloned DNA into competent cells.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null}]}"